{"seq":1,"slug":"cache-key-rrset-ttl-storage-model","title":"缓存键、RRset 存储模型与 TTL 递减/钳制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dns-resolver-recursive-caching-internals-coredns/caching-ttl-negative-cache/cache-key-rrset-ttl-storage-model","wordCount":2430,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存键-rrset-存储模型与-ttl-递减-钳制\">缓存键、RRset 存储模型与 TTL 递减/钳制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>递归解析器把上游答案变成可复用的本地数据，靠两层结构与一套时间语义：<strong>缓存键</strong>决定是否命中，<strong>存储模型</strong>决定命中的粒度，<strong>TTL 递减与钳制</strong>决定还能信任多久。这三者互相约束——键太细共享失效，TTL 不钳制则投毒记录长期驻留，负缓存不分类会让新上线域名在数小时内无法解析。DNS 的缓存语义从报文层面就是**按 RRset（资源记录集）**定义的：同一 name、同一 class、同一 type 的一组记录共享一个 TTL 字段，键的最小单位因此是三元组 <code>(QNAME, QTYPE, QCLASS)</code> 而非整个响应报文。〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2181\">RFC 2181 §5.2</a>〕</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[&quot;客户端查询&lt;br/&gt;shop.example.com A/IN&quot;] --&gt; MC[&quot;消息缓存&lt;br/&gt;key: 查询五元组+标志位&quot;]&#10;  MC --&gt;|&quot;命中完整报文&quot;| ANS[&quot;响应&lt;br/&gt;TTL=过期时刻-当前时刻&quot;]&#10;  MC --&gt;|&quot;未命中&quot;| RC[&quot;RRset 缓存&lt;br/&gt;key: dname+type+class&quot;]&#10;  RC --&gt;|&quot;命中需重组报文&quot;| ANS&#10;  RC --&gt;|&quot;未命中&quot;| UP[&quot;向上游迭代解析&quot;]&#10;  UP --&gt;|&quot;新答案&quot;| RC&#10;  RC --&gt; NEG[&quot;负缓存 NXDOMAIN/NODATA&lt;br/&gt;TTL 来自 SOA MINIMUM&quot;]\">graph TD\n  Q[\"客户端查询&lt;br/&gt;shop.example.com A/IN\"] --&gt; MC[\"消息缓存&lt;br/&gt;key: 查询五元组+标志位\"]\n  MC --&gt;|\"命中完整报文\"| ANS[\"响应&lt;br/&gt;TTL=过期时刻-当前时刻\"]\n  MC --&gt;|\"未命中\"| RC[\"RRset 缓存&lt;br/&gt;key: dname+type+class\"]\n  RC --&gt;|\"命中需重组报文\"| ANS\n  RC --&gt;|\"未命中\"| UP[\"向上游迭代解析\"]\n  UP --&gt;|\"新答案\"| RC\n  RC --&gt; NEG[\"负缓存 NXDOMAIN/NODATA&lt;br/&gt;TTL 来自 SOA MINIMUM\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>键的构成</th>\n<th>共享粒度</th>\n<th>典型容量默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消息缓存</td>\n<td>QNAME+QTYPE+QCLASS+标志位（RD/DO/CD/ECS）</td>\n<td>同一次查询的完整报文</td>\n<td>Unbound <code>msg-cache-size</code> 4m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRset 缓存</td>\n<td>dname（wire format）+type+class</td>\n<td>跨查询共享，多报文引用同一份数据</td>\n<td>Unbound <code>rrset-cache-size</code> 4m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负缓存</td>\n<td>同 RRset 键，附 SOA 提供 TTL</td>\n<td>NXDOMAIN / NODATA 共用一条链</td>\n<td>BIND <code>max-ncache-ttl</code> 10800s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>共享粒度差异有直接后果：消息缓存命中省掉<strong>整个报文重组</strong>，延迟最优；RRset 缓存命中省掉<strong>上游查询</strong>，但仍需拼装报文（CNAME 链 + 目标 A 记录），链上每一跳都是独立键。解析链如何逐段推进见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/delegation-referral-glue-iteration\"><code>../1_dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/2_delegation-referral-glue-iteration.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存键的构成-从-wire-format-到哈希表\">缓存键的构成：从 wire format 到哈希表</h2><p>解析器不把域名当字符串比较。Unbound 的键结构体 <code>packed_rrset_key</code> 只有四个字段：<code>dname</code>（未规范化的 wire format 域名）、<code>dname_len</code>、<code>type</code>、<code>rrset_class</code>，外加承载内部语义的 32 位 <code>flags</code>。〔<a href=\"https://github.com/NLnetLabs/unbound/blob/master/util/data/packed_rrset.h\">Unbound <code>packed_rrset.h</code></a>〕wire format 使比较在第一个不同标签处短路，且天然大小写不敏感——<code>Shop.Example.COM</code> 与 <code>shop.example.com</code> 必须命中同一条目。</p>\n<p><code>flags</code> 不是命名空间的一部分，却是键的<strong>比较字段</strong>：<code>PACKED_RRSET_SOA_NEG</code> 标记负缓存 SOA、<code>PACKED_RRSET_NSEC_AT_APEX</code> 标记 NSEC 位于 apex、<code>PACKED_RRSET_RPZ</code> 标记来自响应策略区。把「是不是负缓存 SOA」编进键，使同一域名可同时存在正、负答案条目而互不覆盖——排障常见坑：看到 NXDOMAIN 不代表缓存里没有该名字的正向数据。配套的 <code>packed_rrset_data</code> 揭示 TTL 存的是<strong>绝对过期时刻</strong>而非倒计时。每个 RR 另有 <code>rr_ttl[i]</code> 数组，但这不是鼓励 RRset 内 TTL 不一致——RFC 2181 已废弃此做法，规定「所有 RR 的 TTL 必须相同」，不一致应视为错误并按<strong>最小 TTL</strong> 处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ttl-递减-钳制与-2-31-1-边界\">TTL 递减、钳制与 2^31-1 边界</h2><p>TTL 定义经过两次修正，是理解现代默认值的入口。<strong>RFC 2181 §8</strong> 明确 TTL 为<strong>无符号数</strong>，范围 0 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2147483647</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}-1 = 2147483647</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2147483647</span></span></span></span></span>，传输时占 32 位字段的低 31 位、最高位必须置 0；收到最高位置 1 的值时应「当作整个值为 0」；并允许实现给 TTL 设上限，「TTL 规定的是<strong>最长</strong>存活时间，而非强制存活时间」——这是所有 <code>max-ttl</code> 的规范依据。〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2181\">RFC 2181 §8</a>〕<strong>RFC 8767 §4</strong> 修订为最高位置 1 按<strong>正数</strong>解读，并建议钳制在「天到周」量级、推荐上限 7 天（604800 秒）。〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8767\">RFC 8767 §4</a>〕\n链路上因此有三种钳制，均可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>clamp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{clamp}(x)=\\min(\\max(x,T_{\\min}),T_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>钳制类型</th>\n<th>作用点</th>\n<th>随报文下发</th>\n<th>典型默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>写缓存时压低过大 TTL</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Unbound <code>cache-max-ttl</code> 86400；BIND <code>max-cache-ttl</code> 604800（7 天）；CoreDNS 成功 3600 / 否定 1800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>写缓存时抬高过小 TTL</td>\n<td>是，但不延长下游 TTL</td>\n<td>Unbound <code>cache-min-ttl</code> 0（禁用）；CoreDNS <code>MINTTL</code> 5；BIND <code>min-cache-ttl</code> 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负缓存上限</td>\n<td>仅作用于 NXDOMAIN/NODATA</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>BIND <code>max-ncache-ttl</code> 10800（3 小时）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>易误解点：<strong>下限钳制不延长下游客户端的 TTL</strong>——一条 30 秒 TTL 的记录即使配 <code>cache 600</code> 仍只缓存 30 秒。Unbound 的 <code>cache-min-ttl</code> 文档更直白：最小值生效时数据被缓存的时间会<strong>长于域名所有者的本意</strong>，高于一小时左右的值可能导致缓存数据不再与实际一致。〔<a href=\"https://coredns.io/plugins/cache/\">CoreDNS cache 插件</a> / <a href=\"https://unbound.docs.nlnetlabs.nl/en/latest/manpages/unbound.conf.html\">Unbound <code>unbound.conf</code></a>〕</p>\n<p>下游看到的 TTL 是<strong>递减</strong>的：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>served</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>expire</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TTL_{\\text{served}} = t_{\\text{expire}} - t_{\\text{now}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">served</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expire</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>expire</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>recv</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>clamp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>upstream</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{expire}} = t_{\\text{recv}} + \\text{clamp}(TTL_{\\text{upstream}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expire</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">upstream</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。递减让下游缓存与上游同步收敛；CoreDNS 的 <code>keepttl</code> 刻意返回原始 TTL，文档明确不建议在缓存非权威记录时使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负数-无数据-与解析失败-两类独立的负缓存\">负数「无数据」与解析失败：两类独立的负缓存</h2><p>负答案没有答案段记录承载 TTL，故 RFC 2308 规定权威返回 NXDOMAIN 或「该类型无数据」（NODATA）时<strong>必须在 authority 段附带该 zone 的 SOA</strong>，其 TTL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>SOA.MINIMUM</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> SOA.TTL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(\\text{SOA.MINIMUM},\\ \\text{SOA.TTL})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SOA.MINIMUM</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SOA.TTL</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并「以与普通缓存答案相同的方式递减，到零时表示缓存的负答案不得再被使用」。该文档澄清了 SOA <code>MINIMUM</code> 被过度复用的历史：它原有三个含义（zone 内所有 RR 的最小 TTL、无显式 TTL 记录的默认值、负响应 TTL），前两个已废弃，<strong>负响应 TTL 是现行定义</strong>。〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2308\">RFC 2308 §3, §4, §5</a>〕</p>\n<p>负缓存键与正缓存共用 <code>(QNAME, QTYPE, QCLASS)</code>，但有两处偏差：NXDOMAIN 按 <code>&lt;QNAME, QCLASS&gt;</code> 检索（名字不存在时任何 QTYPE 都是同一结论），且解析器普遍为负答案单设上限以自保——BIND <code>max-ncache-ttl</code> 默认 10800 秒，无论上游 SOA 多长都被压到该值以下。〔<a href=\"https://bind9.readthedocs.io/en/latest/reference.html\">BIND 9 配置参考</a>〕</p>\n<p>另一类的对象不是「名字不存在」而是「解析失败」（SERVFAIL、超时、DNSSEC 验证失败），机制独立。RFC 9520 规定解析器<strong>必须</strong>实现失败缓存，<strong>不得</strong>缓存超过 5 分钟（与 RFC 2308 一致的上界），且至少 1 秒。〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9520\">RFC 9520 §3.2</a>〕CoreDNS 对应地把 SERVFAIL 缓存 5 秒并允许配置，但不得超过 5 分钟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过期待用-serve-stale-ttl-重写与容量\">过期待用（serve-stale）、TTL 重写与容量</h2><p>RFC 8767 允许无法刷新时把过期记录<strong>当作未过期使用</strong>。其机制由四个计时器驱动：客户端响应计时器（建议 1.8 秒）、查询解析计时器（通常 10–30 秒）、失败重查计时器（建议不高于每 30 秒一次），以及<strong>最大过期待用计时器</strong>（建议 1–3 天）。返回过期记录时 TTL <strong>必须</strong>重写为大于 0 的值，推荐 <strong>30 秒</strong>：TTL 0 对某些实现有问题、负值无法传达，而过短的 TTL 会让客户端（及任何尊重 TTL 的转发解析器）迅速刷新，造成「拥塞崩溃」。二者必须区分——「最大缓存 TTL」钳制上游 TTL（建议 7 天），「最大过期待用计时器」定义过期后还保留多久（建议 1–3 天）。〔以上〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8767\">RFC 8767 §4, §5, §6</a>〕〕</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>过期待用参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>过期记录下发的 TTL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unbound</td>\n<td><code>serve-expired-ttl</code></td>\n<td>86400（1 天），0 表示不限制</td>\n<td>遵循 RFC 8767，返回 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CoreDNS</td>\n<td><code>serve_stale [DURATION]</code></td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td><strong>0</strong>（文档明确「响应 TTL 为 0」）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIND 9</td>\n<td><code>stale-answer-ttl</code></td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n<td>30</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最值得记住的一格是 CoreDNS：它以 TTL 0 下发过期记录，语义是「仅供本次事务使用」，比 RFC 8767 的 30 秒更保守。Unbound 文档解释了这个演进：RFC 之前 Unbound 也用 TTL 0，「RFC 现在推荐返回 30」——CoreDNS 保留了旧行为。〔<a href=\"https://unbound.docs.nlnetlabs.nl/en/latest/topics/core/serve-stale.html\">Unbound 过期待用文档</a>〕</p>\n<p>淘汰与预取是配套的容量机制。Unbound 用带 LRU 的哈希表、容量以字节计（各默认 4m），并在命中「TTL 已消耗到原始值最后 10%」的消息缓存条目时触发 <code>prefetch</code> 后台预取（代价约 10% 额外流量，收益是热门条目永不过期）。CoreDNS 则把缓存切成 <strong>256 个分片</strong>、默认每片 39 条（合计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9984</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256 \\times 39 = 9984</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9984</span></span></span></span></span> 条），<strong>淘汰按片随机而非按 TTL</strong>——TTL 为 0 的条目会一直留在缓存里直到分片满。〔<a href=\"https://coredns.io/plugins/cache/\">CoreDNS cache 插件</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"电商场景的-ttl-规划与失效权衡\">电商场景的 TTL 规划与失效权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>后果与对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CDN / 源站切流</td>\n<td>已缓存数据无法事后缩短</td>\n<td>原 TTL 86400 时，须<strong>提前一个 TTL 周期</strong>（≥1 天）把 TTL 压到 60 秒再切，否则旧地址最长一天内继续承接流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新域名 / 新店铺上线</td>\n<td>曾查询过不存在 → 按 SOA <code>MINIMUM</code> 缓存 NXDOMAIN</td>\n<td>托管商默认 <code>MINIMUM</code> 常为 3600 或更高；须提前改小，并用真实递归器验证负缓存已过期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>源站抖动</td>\n<td><code>serve-expired</code> / <code>serve_stale</code> 顶旧答案</td>\n<td>只兜可用性：可持续返回 REFUSED 的权威<strong>不会</strong>被判定为刷新成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游权威整体故障</td>\n<td>RFC 9520 失败缓存</td>\n<td>5 分钟是不可逾越的上界，配更长只会拉长故障恢复时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规范对「刷新成功」的判定很窄——只有 RCODE 为 0（NoError）或 3（NXDomain）<strong>且 AA 位为 1</strong> 的权威应答才算刷新成功〔<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8767\">RFC 8767 §4</a>〕，故 <code>serve-stale</code> 治的是可用性而非正确性。BIND 的 <code>max-ncache-ttl</code>（默认 3 小时）还会独立封顶负缓存窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>缓存键的最小单位是 <code>(QNAME, QTYPE, QCLASS)</code> 三元组</strong>；Unbound 的 <code>packed_rrset_key</code> 以 <code>dname/type/rrset_class/flags</code> 表达，<code>flags</code> 也是比较字段，因此同一域名可同时存在正、负答案条目。消息缓存命中即回完整报文；RRset 缓存跨查询共享但需重组报文。</li>\n<li><strong>TTL 是无符号 31 位值</strong>：RFC 2181 规定最高位置 1 时按 0 处理并允许设上限；RFC 8767 修订为按正数解读，推荐 7 天为钳制上限。<code>max-ttl</code> 压低过长 TTL 并随报文下发；<code>min-ttl</code> 抬高过短 TTL 但不延长下游看到的 TTL，默认普遍为 0/禁用。</li>\n<li><strong>负缓存 TTL 由 SOA 决定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>neg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>SOA.MINIMUM</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> SOA.TTL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TTL_{\\text{neg}} = \\min(\\text{SOA.MINIMUM},\\ \\text{SOA.TTL})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">neg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SOA.MINIMUM</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SOA.TTL</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，NXDOMAIN 按 <code>&lt;QNAME, QCLASS&gt;</code> 检索；BIND 另用 <code>max-ncache-ttl</code>（默认 10800 秒）封顶。解析失败缓存独立，RFC 9520 要求必须实现，1 秒至 5 分钟。</li>\n<li><strong>过期待用会重写 TTL</strong>：RFC 8767 推荐 30 秒，BIND 采用 30，CoreDNS 采用 0（仅供本次事务），Unbound 默认保留过期记录 1 天。切流前须提前一个 TTL 周期下压 TTL，新域名上线要预判负缓存窗口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解析器类型如何决定缓存归属哪一层，见 <a href=\"../dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/stub-recursive-iterative-resolver-model\"><code>../1_dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/1_stub-recursive-iterative-resolver-model.md</code></a>；正、负答案并存时解析链如何选择与重组，见 <a href=\"../dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/delegation-referral-glue-iteration\"><code>../1_dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/2_delegation-referral-glue-iteration.md</code></a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存键、RRset 存储模型与 TTL 递减/钳制","id":"缓存键-rrset-存储模型与-ttl-递减-钳制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存键的构成：从 wire format 到哈希表","id":"缓存键的构成-从-wire-format-到哈希表"},{"level":2,"text":"TTL 递减、钳制与 2^31-1 边界","id":"ttl-递减-钳制与-2-31-1-边界"},{"level":2,"text":"负数「无数据」与解析失败：两类独立的负缓存","id":"负数-无数据-与解析失败-两类独立的负缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"过期待用（serve-stale）、TTL 重写与容量","id":"过期待用-serve-stale-ttl-重写与容量"},{"level":2,"text":"电商场景的 TTL 规划与失效权衡","id":"电商场景的-ttl-规划与失效权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存根配置实操：resolv.conf、search/ndots、EDNS0 截断与 TCP 回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dns-resolver-recursive-caching-internals-coredns/dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/resolv-conf-stub-search-ndots-ops"},"next":{"title":"NXDOMAIN/NODATA 负缓存与 RFC 2308 SOA MINTTL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dns-resolver-recursive-caching-internals-coredns/caching-ttl-negative-cache/negative-cache-nxdomain-nodata-soa-minttl"}}